<title>HUNGARY: MOL says Croatia pipeline deal fails.</title>
<headline>MOL says Croatia pipeline deal fails.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's oil and gas company MOL Rt said on Tuesday the Croatian Privatisation Fund has rejected MOL's bid for a 12.5 percent stake in the Adriatic pipeline.</p>
<p>&quot;MOL could not enforce its key business interests as a minority shareholder,&quot; MOL said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company added that the decision &quot;will not have any adverse impact on MOL's crude oil supply and, if economics justify, the company will be able to ship crude through this supply route.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
